  "representation_scope": {
    "scope_basis": "instruction.md fixes one Chinese Markdown statement of defense at artifacts/statement-of-defense.md. Legal carrier variation inside that contract: Markdown heading levels, bold party labels and list markers on argument paragraphs; CRLF line endings; amount, date and clause/article notation (thousands separators, 人民币 and .00 suffixes, ISO dates, X.Y条 without 第, spaced clause numbers, 款 for 条, Arabic statute article numbers); a party block written as a Markdown table; and a candidate-style carrier: bold party labels carrying a role parenthetical (答辩人（本案被告）), party particulars on consecutive single lines, horizontal rules, a 事实与理由 H2 with 一、/二、 H3 section headings, numbered list paragraphs with bold lead phrases and inline bold spans, a 结语 heading, a bold court line, 答辩人：B公司（盖章） with a blank 法定代表人 and 二〇二六年 date line, and an appendix heading after the closing. N01-N04 and R03 fold these and they must decide identically to the canonical Markdown transcription of the Golden. Wording variants are proposition-level and are handled by the judge's proposition rules, not by representation cases.",
